  "identity": "An enormous hovering candle-wax guardian in a ragged cool slate-blue mantle. Round drooping ivory melted-wax body, two short lit candle wicks on its crown, a recessed mournful skull-like face with two pale cyan eyes. Heavy wax drips form little mitten hands and a tapered hovering base. Ancient kindly candle keeper with weary comic eyebrows. Keep it a wax spirit, not a skeleton knight.",
  "definition_header": "name THE WAXEN WARDEN\ntext It keeps the last candles lit and sings the dead to sleep.\nby Muse\nwhere crypt\nhp 650\nsize 1.4\nmove hover speed=1.6\nattack aimed shots=1 speed=6 every=65 damage=12 shot=bone\nphases gap_ring reaim flower every=78 volleys=2 damage=10\nrage 40%\ndrops bone 5, wax 4, gold 180",
